# 玩家专属命令的目标：只接受玩家。
#
# 1.12.2 里 give / gamemode / title / spawnpoint / tellraw / playsound /
# trigger / xp / clear / enchant / effect 的目标是用 CommandAbstract.b
# 解析的，那个变体**只找玩家**。gomc 用的是通用解析，任何实体都收。
#
# 这一轮问的是：目标解析不出玩家时，真服说什么。
# 纯控制台就能测（不需要在线玩家），因为"没有玩家"就是解析失败。
#
# 2026-10-21 待测（测完回填）：
#   - ?

--- console ---
say T01
give @e[type=zombie] stone
say T02
give Steve stone
say T03
gamemode creative @e[type=zombie]
say T04
title @e[type=zombie] title hi
say T05
tellraw @e[type=zombie] {"text":"hi"}
say T06
playsound block.stone.break @e[type=zombie] 1 1
say T07
trigger @e[type=zombie] obj set 1
say T08
xp 1 @e[type=zombie]
say T09
clear @e[type=zombie]
say T10
enchant @e[type=zombie] sharpness 1
say T11
effect @e[type=zombie] minecraft:speed 30 1
say T12
spawnpoint @e[type=zombie]
say T13
kill @e[type=zombie]
say T14
testfor @e[type=zombie]
say T15
